{
  "comment": [
    "Forward grouped-convolution instances registered for gfx1250.",
    "",
    "One record per AOT instance, in priority order: when several instances can",
    "run a request, the dispatcher picks the first one listed. A record spells",
    "the instance's KernelIdentity fields that leave its family's baseline",
    "(kernels/conv/kernel_label.py) or the defaults below; its name is the",
    "identity's lossless label. Every instance is a shape-generic AOT binary.",
    "",
    "Selected on gfx1250 from the forward AOT grid (implicit GEMM and direct",
    "depthwise, no merged groups or wavelet), timed with",
    "benchmark_grouped_conv.py over the 2-D fp16/bf16 cases of",
    "bench_cases_conv.json: every case's admitted set holds an instance within",
    "95% of the grid's best for it. Configs are ordered by geomean of their",
    "share of each admitting case's best, then the most generic tile per vector",
    "width; each is listed for fp16 and bf16.",
    "",
    "Edit with library/benchmarks/common/grouped_conv/instance_list.py (labels,",
    "add, format); build and benchmark the instances with",
    "library/benchmarks/common/grouped_conv/benchmark_grouped_conv.py."
  ],
  "arch": "gfx1250",
  "direction": "fwd",
  "defaults": {"llvm_flavor": "llvm22", "wave_size": 32},
